# Never commit these — the safety gate refuses them too, this is the first line
# of defence rather than the last.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.npmrc
*.pem
*.key

.DS_Store

# Agent worktrees and local tooling state — never part of the published tree.
# The safety gate refuses a committed .claude/ regardless of this entry; this
# just keeps it from being staged by an unscoped `git add` in the first place.
.claude/
